cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "chainlink" in publications use:'
type: software
license: EUPL-1.2
title: 'chainlink: Chain-Linked Price and Volume Measures'
version: 0.1.0.9000
abstract: 'Tools to derive price and volume measures of national accounts following
  chapter 8 of the International Monetary Fund (2018) "Quarterly National Accounts
  Manual (2017 Edition)" <https://doi.org/10.5089/9781475589870.069>: Laspeyres-type,
  Paasche-type and Fisher-type volume indices, chain-linking of quarterly or monthly
  volume indices with the annual overlap and the one-quarter overlap techniques, exact
  contributions to percent change of the chain-linked volume measures, and non-additivity
  of the chain-linked series. The benchmarking of the quarterly series on annual data
  can be done with the ''tempdisagg'' package.'
